WN_QGMQ7kNvwH5aula&_nc_oc=AdrNA9HfrJPyz5E0F6FfxKuirAdrMiIGAC3WnSNJl2jaXD1eNsTEuoschck5G125k5g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWPCTNjewZ-0-L3RDYfOTOY9hsn8_5Tj1tr8-8LquyAdA&oe=6B0F15D7"}, {"file_name": "11_extra_snack_bar_night.png", "id": "1132069109707463", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908842212_1132069113040796_2165998262557071187_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6ZE9p4w-LQQQ7kNvwHixGjH&_nc_oc=Ado9s7hjf2NvJjbkmMz7VQURwP3_drJKJ29ECjkpQeHIVl2G0bYATRYJIRyQGXao4o8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWDgdIJ-C8vIoT2UrD_fxKWAiXr9mop-_hbmi9vxoZIVA&oe=6B0EFE88"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "DOS Drive-In VR", "keywords": ["dos"], "long_description": "DOS Drive-In VR turns your Quest into a DOS games console with a drive-in out front.\n\n- A real 3D drive-in: eras, seasons, golden hour or night, a snack bar and a projector beam\n- A shelf of DOS-era shareware: tap a tile and it downloads and plays\n- Play your own legally owned DOS software, added over Wi-Fi or USB\n- Giant arcade deck in the lot: a person-size stick and 8 sewer-cap buttons you stomp or slap\n- Get out of your car and walk the lot\n- Head look for mouse-look games, aim the controller as a mouse, a full VR keyboard, save anywhere\n\nPowered by DOSBox-X (GPL). Source code: github.com/gainesphere-studios/dos-drive-in\n\nThis is an early build. Please report what works and what doesn't.\n\nDOS Drive-In VR isn't affiliated with the DOSBox-X project. Made by Gainesphere Studios.", "short_description": "Your DOS games on a giant drive-in screen. Park at a drive-in at night, pick a shareware game, and play it from your seat, or get out and work a giant arcade stick and sewer-cap buttons in the lot. Powered by DOSBox-X."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gainesphere.com/pages/dos-drive-in-privacy", "de